---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Affiliate disclosure" crumbs={[{ label: "Affiliate disclosure" }]} description="How Pieceworth earns money through affiliate links.">
  <h1 class="pt-6 font-serif text-[40px] leading-tight">Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <div class="prose-text mt-8">
    <p>
      Some links on Pieceworth are affiliate links. If you click one and buy something, the store may pay us a
      commission. It doesn't change the price you pay.
    </p>
    <p>
      Affiliate links are marked « Affiliate link » next to the button. Stores don't pay to be included, don't review
      our guides before publication, and can't change what we write about them.
    </p>
    <p>
      We only cover stores we would consider buying from ourselves, and every guide lists the limits of each store,
      not just its advantages.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
